Hp Series:
  A Harmonic Progression (HP) is a sequence where the reciprocals of the terms form an Arithmetic Progression (AP).
  In mathematics, the HP series formula (Harmonic Progression) is the reciprocal of an Arithmetic Progression (AP) formula.
  For a series , the  term is given by: 
  1/a, 1/a + d, 1/ a+ 2d

